# Extension ID pinning — private key stays out of the repo (public key lives in manifest.json)
extension-key.pem
pubkey.b64

# Participant data — never commit. Session exports, decision traces, corrected
# exports and the coder's labels are research records: they belong in your
# study's own storage under whatever your ethics approval specifies, not in the
# code repository and certainly not pushed to GitHub. The exports hold no
# document text by design, but they are still per-participant records.
#
# Covers everything the panel downloads (P01_baseline_2026-09-16.json / .csv /
# _trace.csv), what the analysis writes (_corrected.json), and coding files,
# including coders' working copies.
P[0-9]*_*.json
P[0-9]*_*.csv
P[0-9]*.csv
P_*.csv
*_coding.csv
*_trace.csv
*_corrected.json

# Excel's lock file, created beside any spreadsheet while it is open
~$*

# Throwaway analysis scripts
analysis/_tmp_*

# Local Claude Code settings
.claude/

# Windows
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Keys of any kind
*.pem
